Theorem DP-1: is_rc_needed truth table

  Preconditions:
    - s is an AimsState per the canonical proof notation
      sec-Per-Dimension-Symbol-Set
    - is_rc_needed: AimsState -> Bool per Annex E §AIMS DP-1 +
      Appendix C truth table
    - is_scalar(s) per L-9 (SCALAR is sentinel; excluded from lattice
      operations)

  Soundness property:
    Forall s in AimsState.
      is_rc_needed(s)
        iff (s.access = O and s.consumption != Dead and not is_scalar(s))

  Proof obligation:
    Case analysis on (Access, Consumption, is_scalar) tuple per
    Appendix C DP-1 truth table:
      Case (s.access = Borrowed, any consumption, any is_scalar):
        DP-1 returns false.
        Soundness: predicate false (first conjunct fails).
      Case (s.access = O, s.consumption = Dead, any is_scalar):
        DP-1 returns false.
        Soundness: predicate false (second conjunct fails).
      Case (s.access = O, s.consumption != Dead, is_scalar = true):
        DP-1 returns false.
        Soundness: predicate false (third conjunct fails).
      Case (s.access = O, s.consumption != Dead, is_scalar = false):
        DP-1 returns true.
        Soundness: predicate true (all three conjuncts hold);
        s carries a refcountable owned non-scalar value requiring RC.

    Exhaustiveness: the four cases cover all (Access, Consumption,
    is_scalar) tuples; Access in {Borrowed, O} (2 values), Consumption
    in {Dead, L, A, U} (4 values), is_scalar in {true, false} (2
    values) -> 16 product combinations; cases above partition the 16
    combinations by predicate value.

    Live-variable set typed pre-pass dependency: NOT REQUIRED for DP-1
    (DP-1 is a pure boolean predicate over canonical AimsState
    dimensions; only DP-5 consumes the live-variable set per
    Annex E §AIMS DP-5 + the proof-checker design Engine-per-Category-Inventory
    DP row).

    Engines dispatched:
      case_analysis (for the (Access, Consumption, is_scalar) tuple
                     enumeration above; refinement engine NOT dispatched
                     per the proof-checker design DP row clarification —
                     refinement has no DP work)

  Expected:
    status: valid
    reason: section_05 case_analysis engine discharges DP-1 via 16-state Appendix C truth-table enumeration; DP-shape coverage flipped per the section-05 coverage manifest
